@startuml
[*] --> queued : Job enqueued to SQS
queued --> processing : Worker picks up message

state processing {
  [*] --> extracting : Extracting text/transcript
  extracting --> chunking : Splitting text into chunks
  chunking --> calling_llm : Requesting cards from Groq/Gemini
  calling_llm --> deduplicating : Ranking & filtering duplicates
  deduplicating --> creating_deck : Saving cards and creating deck
}

processing --> completed : Generation succeeded & Deck saved
processing --> failed : LLM failed / validation failed / S3 error
processing --> cancelled : Aborted by user via abort API

completed --> [*]
failed --> [*]
cancelled --> [*]
@enduml
